+              "The source is Dukascopy USATECH.IDX/USD BID one-minute data, an index/CFD proxy. It is not a dated CME NQ contract. The source manifest ends on 2026-07-14. The source-feature calculation excludes later observations.", "",
+              "Cboe described January 2026 as a broadening away from mega-cap technology, with Russell 2000 up 5.31% and MGTN down 0.8%. Cboe described June leadership rotation, with Russell 2000 up 3.6%, MGTN down 9.2%, and VIX moving from 15.3 to 16.5. Those are public monthly descriptions, not matched trade-level causes. Nasdaq blocked retrieval of its February, April, and May pages in this run. I have not used those claims in the attribution. Event/month alignment is a hypothesis only.", "",
