+             f"The strongest verified explanation is weak realized breakout payoff across this observed 2026 sample, with negative PnL already before modeled costs. Shorts lost most of the total. The strategy recorded stop fills on {recorded_stops} trades, but every trade-ledger `exit_reason` is `signal`; the native `fills.csv` order type is required to separate protective STOP fills from market time exits. Source bars show {ohlc_touches} post-entry 1-minute OHLC touches of the nominal 50-point stop level. The difference may include minute-path ambiguity or unmatched triggers. Costs widen the loss. These observations do not identify a macro cause.", "",
