+              "The chart reports daily trend and realized volatility for the same local index proxy. These features do not represent a separate official Nasdaq index or a causal macro variable. The monthly values are in `metrics.json`.", "",
+              "Cboe described January 2026 as broadening beyond mega-cap technology, with Russell 2000 up 5.31% and MGTN down 0.8% ([Cboe](https://www.cboe.com/insights/posts/index-insights-january-2026/)). Cboe described June leadership rotation, with Russell 2000 up 3.6%, MGTN down 9.2%, and VIX rising from 15.3 to 16.5 ([Cboe](https://www.cboe.com/insights/posts/index-insights-june-2026/)). Nasdaq's official scorecard search results report NDX down 2.3% in February, up 15.6% in April, and up 10.5% in May ([February](https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/global-indexes/index-monthly-scorecard-february-2026), [April](https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/global-indexes/monthly-scorecard-april-2026), [May](https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/global-indexes/monthly-scorecard-may-2026)). Nasdaq page retrieval was blocked, so this report uses only those monthly return values and does not repeat driver claims from the pages. These public summaries do not match trade entry times. Any event/month link to PnL is a hypothesis only.", "",
+              "## Confidence and limits", "",
+              "- **Verified:** ledger identities, counts, PnL, modeled costs, monthly and conditional sums, entry-side/exit categories, entry timestamps, source cutoff, and matched same-season sample.",
+              "- **Inference:** one-bar breakout entries may have had poorer immediate follow-through or more reversals in the observed period. Regime slices can show association, but not causal effect.",
+              "- **Hypothesis:** monthly macro narratives may coincide with trade outcomes. Broad index returns do not explain intraday proxy PnL without event-time matching.",
+              "- One-minute OHLC cannot determine the event order inside a minute. The engine's OCO is non-atomic. Stop gaps can exceed nominal risk. Annual runs reset account state. The run does not verify CME contract mapping, bid/ask execution, or certified costs.",
